{"title": "同一请求，off 与 on 两种答案", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "real_ip_recursive off;   # 名单只有 127.0.0.1"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -H \"X-Forwarded-For: 203.0.113.7, 10.0.0.5\" localhost"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "remote_addr=10.0.0.5"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "real_ip_recursive on;    # 名单 127.0.0.1 + 10.0.0.5"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -H \"X-Forwarded-For: 203.0.113.7, 10.0.0.5\" localhost"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "remote_addr=203.0.113.7"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "off 把没进名单的 10.0.0.5 当客户端，封禁就封它"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
